  <h2 id="why-popular">Why the DMPX-014 Is Our Most Popular Mid-Range Model</h2>
  <p>
    The DMPX-014 occupies the space between compact entry-level machines and larger industrial units. Published diesel capacity is 3,300 L/h (14.53 US GPM derived) on MOPX 205 and 3,700 L/h (16.29 US GPM derived) on WHPX 405. Waste oil, biodiesel, and food-oil flows are application-specific and are not inferred from these diesel values.
  </p>
  <p>
    Its self-cleaning design makes it suitable for feeds with significant solids loading that would require frequent manual shutdowns on a simpler bowl centrifuge. Operators with experience on manual-clean machines who switch to the DMPX-014 consistently report that labor time drops dramatically while processing quality improves.
  </p>
  <p>
    For a detailed comparison of DMPX-014 against other Dolphin centrifuge models, see our <a href="/alfa-laval-centrifuge-selection-guide/">centrifuge selection guide</a>.
